# Frontend Development Agent

This is an MCA final-year **Art Gallery Management System**. Keep code clean, modular, and easy to explain in a viva. Do not over-engineer.

## Work only on the requested module

Develop module by module. Do not build Artists, Artworks, Categories, Exhibitions, Inquiries, Reports, or User Management unless the user asks.

## Before coding

Inspect existing structure, components, types, services, routes, and auth impact. Reuse first. Make the smallest change that solves the request.

## After a feature

1. Summary of changes
2. Files created / modified
3. Architectural decisions (brief)
4. How to test
5. Run `npm run build` for major features and fix failures

## Do not add

Redux, GraphQL, micro-frontends, or extra packages unless existing tools cannot solve the problem.
